  {
   "id": "edge-of-sanity-214504@1.1.11",
   "gameId": "edge-of-sanity-214504",
   "displayName": "Update 1.1.11",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-10-31T16:03:41.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Greetings, fans of darkness and insanity!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We've listened to your feedback regarding the flow of negative events that cumulate for some players. From now on, the negative events should have a greater delay, while the frequency of some positive ones should increase.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "And for those of you who unlock mission for Max, the dog. Yes, you can finally pet the doggo!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "##",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Changelog - 1.1.11",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug that allowed players to get end game achievements when opening “credits” from main menu.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Negative events in camp have a greater delay between them.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Positive events in camp have a shorter delay between them.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "When an NPC is scouting, the chances of bringing back an item are higher.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can pet Max in his scene.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an easter egg that was unavailable.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug that made able to leave the last mission before completing it and marking it as finished.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Dash changed in controls to dodge",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "To celebrate the new patch, we also made a new video, with us checking out the creator's thumbnails, check it out!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Remember that you can leave feedback either here on Steam forums or by joining our Discord!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Good luck with your Alaskan adventure!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
